~ sign
do disable_movement()
The board is old. The lettering has been cut in, not painted, and then gone over again later by a steadier hand.
Sign: OLD RIDGE ROAD — CLOSED
Sign: NO WAY THROUGH. DO NOT CLEAR IT.
Someone has scratched three short notches under the last line, one below the other.
do enable_movement()
=> END

~ barricade
do disable_movement()
Rails across the road, lashed at the posts. Not thrown together in a hurry — whoever did this meant it to last.
Beyond it the trees close up completely. Whatever the road went to, it doesn't go there now.
do enable_movement()
=> END
